  "description": "FAST 700C ALL-ROAD RIDE\n\nFast acceleration with extreme versatility, the Vasco GT 28 is a performance gravel bike that can do it all. More than that, though, it is a gravel bike that wants it all. Built around a pure, steel frame and an all-road setup, the smooth-running tires (700C x 40mm) provide extra speed in the field while the performance derailleur-shifting ensures easy gear changes even on rough roads. The numerous mounting options for bags and accessories enable bikepacking tours of all kinds, making the Vasco an absolute all-road all-rounder—perfect for performance gravel on any terrain.\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\nSpecifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
